  "title": "Identification of compatible product",
  "content": "<p>Hi, Please forgive my ignorance in advance.<br /><br />I have been asked to acquire the equivalent of the hardware show in the attached photographs (both items).<br /><br />I am hoping that someone in the community can point me at the relevant product in on this website. I don’t have experience of what the product is used for to be able to make a proper judgement myself.<br /><br />I suspect the one that I have is old and has been replaced with a newer model, hence my inability to find a direct match in the product pages.<br /><br />Any assistance would be much appreciated.<br /><br />Thank you for your time.</p>",
