      "is_best": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hello ​<user-mention data-id=\"108277\">@KMarshall</user-mention> and welcome to the ST community,</p><p>The device you are showing in the picture is the <a href=\"https://www.st.com/en/development-tools/st-link-v2.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">STLINK-V2</a>. </p><p>If you need an update you can migrate to <a href=\"https://www.st.com/en/development-tools/stlink-v3set.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">STLINK-V3</a></p><p>Hope that helps.</p></div>"
    },
    {
      "is_best": false,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Wow, thanks! That was fast! I’ll check it out and see if the people who need it agree that it’s the solution for them</p></div>"
    },
    {
      "is_best": false,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Look at <a href=\"https://www.st.com/resource/en/user_manual/um2448-stlinkv3set-debuggerprogrammer-for-stm8-and-stm32-stmicroelectronics.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">UM2448 </a>for their reference.</p><p>And see also another STLINK-V3 flavor a compact one: <a href=\"https://www.st.com/en/development-tools/stlink-v3mods.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">STLINK-V3MODS</a> (<a href=\"https://www.st.com/resource/en/user_manual/um2502-stlinkv3mods-and-stlinkv3mini-debuggerprogrammer-tiny-probes-for-stm32-microcontrollers-stmicroelectronics.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">UM2502</a>)</p></div>"
    },
    {
      "is_best": false,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Thanks, I’ve downloaded the data sheet </p></div>"
    },
    {
      "is_best": false,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>See also:     <a href=\"https://www.st.com/resource/en/technical_note/tn1235-overview-of-stlink-derivatives-stmicroelectronics.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>TN1235</strong></a>, <em>Overview of ST-LINK derivatives</em> - that lists &amp; describes all available options.</p><p> </p><p><strong><u>PS</u>:</strong></p><p>Beware of fakes/clones - be sure to buy from an <a href=\"https://www.st.com/content/st_com/en/contact-us.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">Authorised Distributor</a>.</p><p>See also:</p><oembed url=\"https://community.st.com/stm32-mcus-60/how-to-recognize-a-genuine-st-link-v2-versus-a-cloned-one-87\"></oembed><p> </p></div>"
